        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/Easy-mode-gta.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>By now, you've probably heard that you cannot use cheats in <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/gta-6-walkthrough\">GTA 6</a> <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/gta-6-no-cheats-until-completing-main-story\">until you complete the main story</a>. Not only that, but enabling cheat codes also locks story progression and deactivates the ability to save. Basically, you can use cheats to have a quick crime spree and blow off some steam, then it's back to normalcy. Understandably, some gamers are a little put out with this change.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/gta-6-easy-mode-accessibility-options\">Read more</a></p>",
